Generate an electrical field around you in a radius of [1, 2, 3, 5, 6 (TL1-5)]. Any creature caught inside will lose up to [28%, 33%, 37%, 40%, 42% (TL1-5; MP 100)] of its current life ([18%, 22%, 25%, 26%, 28% (TL1-5; MP 100)] if the target is Elite or Rare, [14%, 17%, 18%, 20%, 21% (TL1-5; MP 100)] if the target is a Unique or Boss, and [11%, 13%, 15%, 16%, 17% (TL1-5; MP 100)] if they are an Elite Boss.). This life drain is irresistable, but can be saved against with physical save.

Additionally, it will deal [96, 129, 155, 177, 196 (TL1-5; MP 100)] lightning damage afterwards, regardless of target rank.

Current life loss and lightning damage will increase with your Mindpower, and the lightning damage element can critically hit with mental critical chances.

Each point in storm drake talents also increases your lightning resistance by 1%.
